      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Layer 1  Tools ko normally test karo (deterministic)\nLayer 2  Guards ko mock model se test karo (step limit, loop detect, deny)\nLayer 3  End-to-end EVALS, N runs:\n         assert success_rate > 0.80   ← threshold, exact match NAHI\n         assert median_cost < 0.50 and p95_steps < 20",
      "originalText": "Layer 1  Tools ko normally test karo (deterministic)\nLayer 2  Guards ko mock model se test karo (step limit, loop detect, deny)\nLayer 3  End-to-end EVALS, N runs:\n         assert success_rate > 0.80   ← threshold, exact match NAHI\n         assert median_cost < 0.50 and p95_steps < 20",
